<title>UK: BOE sets 5-31/32 pct rate on UK money market repos.</title>
<headline>BOE sets 5-31/32 pct rate on UK money market repos.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England set an unchanged rate of 5-31/32 percent on repos and secured loan facilities starting on November 21, 22 and 25.</p>
<p>The rate is the same as that currently applying to the Bank's day-to-day money market repos.</p>
<p>The two-week repos will mature on December 5, 6 and 9. The four-week option matures on December 19, 20 and 23.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7708</p>
